retrieval_text:
Category: STP2
Requirement 1: Letter request addressed to the PRB Chairperson requesting for the issuance of STP to foreign professional to be engaged as a consultant in foreign-funded, joint venture or foreign-assisted projects of the government indicating the following in bullet points the date and venue of the undertaking and name of Filipino Professional counterpart with current roles and responsibilities in the company to qualify as counterpart and provide with narratives of the detailed expertise, skills and competencies of foreign applicant that will be transferred to the counterpart for the duration of the undertaking of foreign applicant;
Requirement 2: Notarized copy of the Contract of Employment or Services, or Memorandum of Agreement between the government agency and the foreign professional, indicating the terms of reference, nature of engagement, scope, duration and other project or contract details

